#!/usr/bin/env bash
set -euo pipefail

TITLE="${1:-service-slowdown}"

INCIDENT_DIR="$(./bin/rcl-new-incident "$TITLE")"

cat <<EOF2
Use prod-triage-agent.

Incident workspace:
${INCIDENT_DIR}

Start a new RootCauseLab troubleshooting session.

Rules:
- Use incident-intake first.
- Ask me one question at a time.
- Do not ask me to edit YAML manually.
- You must fill session.yaml yourself.
- You must save raw command outputs under evidence/.
- You must update findings.md and timeline.md after each meaningful step.
- After intake, choose the correct triage skill.
- Only request read-only production commands.
- Treat session.yaml as canonical memory.
- Do not rely on chat memory as source of truth.

Begin with the first intake question.
EOF2
